OL,3,ASeven planes searched after suspected
OL,4,Abomb threats across Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plane that departed Manchester was
OL,7,Finspected in Murcia, Spain, where a
OL,8,Flocal official said no explosives were
OL,9,Ffound
OL,11,FOn Monday, a flight from London Luton
OL,12,Fto Sofia made an emergency landing in
OL,13,FBudapest, following a bomb threat
